{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261126/photo/bkn-20261126084329417-1126_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261126120723\"/><p>事主被送往北大嶼山醫院。</p><p>東涌有人暈倒亡。今日(26日)早上8時12分，一名男子報案，指其47歲妻子在迎康街1號一單位內暈倒。人員接報到場，將昏迷事主送往北大嶼山醫院治理，其後被證實死亡。女子死因有待驗屍後確定。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:20:21.480256+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T00:43:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T08:16:47.206586+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T04:13:54.215759+00:00","content_hash":"cb3ca053287b68e9d1898db5f768ec2741fd5b8c642564e3ddc4896b22695efc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}